Misty: live Timepiece Suite table (12 Oct 2026) as default preset, Mistees economy tab

The live page was captured on 12 October 2026: 17 outcomes, odds sum 100.16%,
1 in 61 physical item, Rolex at 1 in 25,000, about 2.8 Mistees per open
including the two Free Spin outcomes. Terms define Mistees as site credit with
no cash value, redeemable only for boxes and products; no dollar rate is
published, so credit items carry an assumed $1 face and $0.37 real cost.

- captured.ts: mistyTimepieceLive box and items (live capture, not a reconstruction)
- operators.ts: live table is the Misty default; 9 Oct reconstruction and Penthouse kept
  as presets; new Mistees economy tab (sellback lab, credit re-spent on boxes, only
  items leave); competitions tab relabelled
- skins.ts: player and settings guides for the three Misty tabs
- presets.ts: captured-misty-live preset so the smoke script covers it
  (stated 65.5%, realized 64.3%, cash 35.9%, verify 100/100)

